# dist IS committed - the cPanel server cannot run Chrome, so react-snap
# prerendering only works on a developer machine. The built HTML has to
# reach the server some other way, so it goes through git.
#
# dist/assets is NOT committed. Those are the same ~178 MB of images that
# already live in public/assets, and they are already on the server in
# public_html/assets. Committing them twice would push the repo past
# 350 MB and make every clone and pull time out on shared hosting.
dist/assets/

